{
  "job_B1.5.7_20251001_193248": {
    "chunk_text": "Simile est regnum celorum homini regi & religua. Cristes iwun\u00e6 w\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6t he wolde oft sp\u00e6c\u00e6n on deopum bigspellum to his discipulis; \u00f0a s\u00e6de he hwilon Heofene rice is ilic ane kynge, he \u00f0e h\u00e6fde mot wi\u00f0 his men hwilon & wolde mid gesceade settan his He sp\u00e6c \u00fea wi\u00f0 \u00e6nne mon \u00fee him ahte to geldene ten \u00feusend pund\u00e6, & manode him \u00fe\u00e6s feos. \u00d0a n\u00e6fde \u00fee \u00f0egen nane mihte to \u00feam \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00f0am laforde his lane forgylde; ac \u00fee laford het \u00fea l\u00e6don \u00dea feol \u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6gen adun to his lafordes fotum & b\u00e6d hine georne mid \u00feissum worde, cw\u00e6\u00f0ende, La, \u00d0e laford \u00fea mildsode \u00feam \u00f0egene \u00feerrihte, & l\u00e6t hine faren, & all \u00fe\u00e6t feoh him forgeaf. \u00d0a eode \u00fee \u00f0egen ut; & he efne \u00fea imette sumne o\u00f0erne mon of his agenum iferum, \u00fee ahte him to & il\u00e6hte hine son\u00e6, & l\u00e6gde hine adun & hine of\u00f0ryhte, \u00f0us cw\u00e6\u00f0ende him to, Ageld nu swi\u00f0e ra\u00f0\u00e6 \u00d0a ge\u00e6lnode \u00f0e o\u00f0er hine up swa \u00f0eah, & feol to his fotum fyrstes him biddende. Bihet \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde al his feoh him forgeld\u00e6n. \u00dea nolde \u00fee \u00f0egen l\u00e6ten him n\u00e6nne fyrst, ac sette hine on cwearterne mid swi\u00f0licum gram\u00e6 o\u00f0 \u00f0et he \u00d0a is\u00e6gen \u00fea hiredmen hu \u00f0e \u00feegen dyde embe \u00f0one o\u00f0erne, & unrodsoden",
